es into attacking their own minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Synergy Chains\u200b</strong>\u200b: Qili\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bposition-resetting combos\u200b</strong>\u200b, Diego\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bcounter-trap ambushes\u200b</strong>\u200b, Daniel\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bstatus-spreading explosions\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014every action breeds lethal potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threat Priorities\u200b</strong>\u200b: Execute healers first? Interrupt charging elites? Every turn demands life-or-death decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258dFreeform Build System\u200b</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.poster.avif?t=1759222788\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.webm?t=1759222788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.mp4?t=1759222788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix \u200b<strong>\u200b112 tactical components\u200b</strong>\u200b: 12 hero-exclusive relics \u00d7 9 game-breaking equipment \u00d7 7 high-risk Burning Kindling effects. Craft builds like \u200b<strong>\u200bBlink Crit\u200b</strong>\u200b, \u200b<strong>\u200bCounter Tank\u200b</strong>\u200b, or \u200b<strong>\u200bToxin Overload\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014your creativity is the ultimate weapon.</p>","developers":["Fun Square Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i